xaa04 comp-ld08xaa04__0528c3cb-923e-43f3-968e-cc60367633b2 wixui-rich-text\" data-testid=\"richTextElement\"><p class=\"font_9 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">This presentation presents the final research findings for the CirclesUBI.id implementation across 3 regions in Bali, Indonesia. It can be used to showcase how digital points can build community resilience.<br>............................................................................................................<br>Presentasi ini menyajikan temuan penelitian akhir untuk implementasi CirclesUBI.id di 3 wilayah di Bali, Indonesia. Ini dapat digunakan untuk menunjukkan bagaimana poin digital dapat membangun ketahanan komunitas.</span></p></div><div id=\"comp-ld08xaa43__0528c3cb-923e-43f3-968e-cc60367633b2\" class=\"comp-ld08xaa43 comp-ld08xaa43__0528c3cb-923e-43f3-968e-cc60367633b2\" data-semantic-classname=\"button\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"StylableButton2545352419__root style-lexmylek__root wixui-button\" data-testid=\"buttonContent\" aria-label=\"Bahasa Indonesia\"><span class=\"StylableButton2545352419__container\"><span class=\"StylableButton2545352419__label wixui-button__label\" data-testid=\"stylablebutton-label\">Bahasa Indonesia</span><span class=\"StylableButton2545352419__icon wixui-button__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-testid=\"stylablebutton-icon\"><span><svg data-bbox=\"9 70.9 181 59\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 200\">\n    <g>\n        <path d=\"M159 70.9l-2.2 2.4L183.6 99H9v3h174.6l-26.2 25.3 2.1 2.6 30.5-29.3-31-29.7z\"></path>\n    </g>\n</svg>\n</span></span></span></button></div></div></div></div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"_FiCX\"><div id=\"comp-ld08xa9j3__9aa3b9fc-a8c1-4b44-83ad-a44779d3b694\" class=\"comp-ld08xa9j3 comp-ld08xa9j3__9aa3b9fc-a8c1-4b44-83ad-a44779d3b694 FDI5TK wixui-repeater__item\"><div id=\"bgLayers_comp-ld08xa9j3__9aa3b9fc-a8c1-4b44-83ad-a4