ook\" width=\"258\" height=\"172\" srcset=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/2ca196_d05bb117a9924e869fc6f44cd9b97a93~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_258,h_172,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Open%20Book.png 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/2ca196_d05bb117a9924e869fc6f44cd9b97a93~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_516,h_344,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Open%20Book.png 2x\" fetchpriority=\"high\" style=\"width: 258px; height: 172px; object-fit: cover;\"></wow-image></div></div><div id=\"comp-ld08xa9t__8808bb0d-01d2-4f66-ba7d-94fdbadf9cd3\" class=\"N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV comp-ld08xa9t comp-ld08xa9t__8808bb0d-01d2-4f66-ba7d-94fdbadf9cd3 wixui-rich-text\" data-testid=\"richTextElement\"><h6 class=\"font_6 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Impact Assessment Report by BRIN</span></h6></div><div id=\"comp-ld08xa9v3__8808bb0d-01d2-4f66-ba7d-94fdbadf9cd3\" class=\"N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV comp-ld08xa9v3 comp-ld08xa9v3__8808bb0d-01d2-4f66-ba7d-94fdbadf9cd3 wixui-rich-text\" data-testid=\"richTextElement\"><p class=\"font_9 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\"><span style=\"font-family:wfont_5d7f4c_b6170deb7b1a448185083550d0371b51,wf_b6170deb7b1a448185083550d,orig_poppins_semibold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#3DB6B6;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">FORMAT: PDF REPORT</span></span></span></p></div><div id=\"comp-ld08xa9x4__8808bb0d-01d2-4f66-ba7d-94fdbadf9cd3\" class=\"N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV comp-ld08xa9x4 comp-ld08xa9x4__8808bb0d-01d2-4f66-ba7d-94fdbadf9cd3 wixui-rich-text\" data-testid=\"richTextElement\"><p class=\"font_9 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\"><span style=\"font-family:wfont_5d7f4c_b6170deb7b1a448185083550d0371b51,wf_b6170deb7b1a448185083550d,orig_poppins_semibold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#4A9F76;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">USEFUL FOR: FACILITATORS &amp; TRAINERS</span></span></span></p></div><div id=\"comp-ld08xaa04__8808bb0d-01d2-4f66-ba7d-94fdbadf9cd3\" class=\"N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV comp-ld08xaa04 comp-ld08xaa04__8808bb0d-01d2-4f66-ba7d-94fdbadf9cd3 wixui-rich-text\" data-testid=\"richTextElement\"><p class=\"font_9 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">The report by Indonesia's National Research and Innovation Agency (BRIN) assessed the program's impact on participants' finances, health, food security, social ties, and life satisfaction compared to control groups, highlighting its effect on targeted communities' well-being.<br>............................................................................................................<br>Kajian dampak dari Badan Riset dan Inovasi Nasional (BRIN) Indonesia menilai dampak program terhadap keuangan, kesehatan, ketahanan pangan, hubungan sosial, dan kepuasan hidup peserta dibandingkan dengan kelompok kontrol, menyoroti pengaruhnya terhadap kesejahteraan masyarakat sasaran.</span></p></div><div id=\"comp-ld08xaa43__8808bb0d-01d2-4f66-ba7d-94fdbadf9cd3\" class=\"comp-ld08xaa43 comp-ld08xaa43__8808bb0d-01d2-4f66-ba7d-94fdbadf9cd3\" data-semantic-classname=\"button\"><a data-testid=\"linkElement\" href=\"https://www.circlesubi.id/id/_files/ugd/2ca196_48f721c6ae4945d4aeefbc2c94a34015.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"StylableButton2545352419__root style-lexmylek__root wixui-button StylableButton2545352419__link\" aria-label=\"Bahasa Indonesia\"><span class=\"StylableButton2545352419__container\"><span class=\"StylableButton2545352419__label wixui-button__label\" data-testid=\"stylablebutton-label\">Bahasa Indonesia</span><span class=\"StylableButton2545352419__icon wixui-button__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-testid=\"stylablebutton-icon\"><span><svg data-bbox=\"9 70.9 181 59\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.