hTextElement\"><p class=\"font_9 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\"><span style=\"font-family:wfont_5d7f4c_b6170deb7b1a448185083550d0371b51,wf_b6170deb7b1a448185083550d,orig_poppins_semibold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#4A9F76;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">USEFUL FOR: TRAINERS &amp; FACILITATORS</span></span></span></p></div><div id=\"comp-ld08xaa04__b037b47f-e78b-4814-832f-3c9922301fc7\" class=\"N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV comp-ld08xaa04 comp-ld08xaa04__b037b47f-e78b-4814-832f-3c9922301fc7 wixui-rich-text\" data-testid=\"richTextElement\"><p class=\"font_9 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">This presentation is used to onboard users into a Circles pilot project, including how they participate in testing, and evaluating the impacts of Circles in their community.<br>............................................................................................................<br>Presentasi ini digunakan untuk mengenalkan program uji coba Circles kepada para pengguna, termasuk bagaimana mereka berpartisipasi dalam uji coba aplikasi, dan mengevaluasi pengaruh Circles di komunitas mereka.</span></p></div><div id=\"comp-ld08xaa43__b037b47f-e78b-4814-832f-3c9922301fc7\" class=\"comp-ld08xaa43 comp-ld08xaa43__b037b47f-e78b-4814-832f-3c9922301fc7\" data-semantic-classname=\"button\"><a data-testid=\"linkElement\" href=\"https://www.circlesubi.id/id/_files/ugd/3247ab_097f0a0e5ee74925bbbff650d80985a8.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"StylableButton2545352419__root style-lexmylek__root wixui-button StylableButton2545352419__link\" aria-label=\"Bahasa Indonesia\"><span class=\"StylableButton2545352419__container\"><span class=\"StylableButton2545352419__label wixui-button__label\" data-testid=\"stylablebutton-label\">Bahasa Indonesia</span><span class=\"StylableButton2545352419__icon wixui-button__icon\