fV comp-ld08xa9x4 comp-ld08xa9x4__73b90c75-9947-4eaf-ad43-bb33cc4e6b82 wixui-rich-text\" data-testid=\"richTextElement\"><p class=\"font_9 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\"><span style=\"font-family:wfont_5d7f4c_b6170deb7b1a448185083550d0371b51,wf_b6170deb7b1a448185083550d,orig_poppins_semibold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#4A9F76;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">USEFUL FOR: ALL READERS</span></span></span></p></div><div id=\"comp-ld08xaa04__73b90c75-9947-4eaf-ad43-bb33cc4e6b82\" class=\"N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV comp-ld08xaa04 comp-ld08xaa04__73b90c75-9947-4eaf-ad43-bb33cc4e6b82 wixui-rich-text\" data-testid=\"richTextElement\"><p class=\"font_9 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">This report includes detailed feedback from communities in three regencies of Bali on their opinion of the viability of implementing Circles in Bali. This community consultation was implemented in 2021.<br>............................................................................................................<br>Laporan ini mencangkup tanggapan terperinci dari komunitas di tiga kabupaten di Bali mengenai pendapat mereka tentang kelangsungan implementasi Circles di Bali. Wawancara komunitas ini dilaksanakan pada 2021.</span></p></div><div id=\"comp-ld08xaa43__73b90c75-9947-4eaf-ad43-bb33cc4e6b82\" class=\"comp-ld08xaa43 comp-ld08xaa43__73b90c75-9947-4eaf-ad43-bb33cc4e6b82\" data-semantic-classname=\"button\"><a data-testid=\"linkElement\" href=\"https://www.circlesubi.id/id/_files/ugd/3247ab_cec44dd7b1214c35af76d884950f625b.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"StylableButton2545352419__root style-lexmylek__root wixui-button StylableButton2545352419__link\" aria-label=\"Bahasa Indonesia\"><span class=\"StylableButton2545352419__container\"><span class=\"StylableButton2545352419__label wixui-button__label\" data-te